  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently the Camera Mode sub menu is ordered as follows:\n\nLocal Photo | Gallery Photo | User Icon | Multi Layer | Emoji | Animated Emoji | Animated Emoji\n\nThis sorting feels a bit wrong as you essentially have: \n\nLocal Stuff | Gallery / Icon | Local Stuff | Emoji Stuff\n\nWhich feels a bit unorganized to me.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nMove the \"Multi Layer\" button to the right of the Local Photo button, so that the sub menu would be organized like this:\n\nLocal Photo | Multi Layer | Gallery Photo | User Icon | Emoji | Animated Emoji | Animated Emoji\n\nDoing this would essentially split the Camera Mode sub menu into 3 sections:  \n\nLocal Stuff | Gallery / Icon | Emoji\n\nIf you want to be real fancy you could even add some separation lines between these 3 sections :D\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a picture showcasing the issue:",
